**1. QuickShip Logistics, Inc.**  
a Delaware corporation with its principal place of business at 123 Shipping Lane, Wilmington, DE 19801 ("QuickShip"),  

**2. FastTrack Trucking Services, LLC**  
a limited liability company organized under the laws of New Jersey, with its principal place of business at 456 Freight Road, Newark, NJ 07102 ("FastTrack"),  

