### ARTICLE I: DEFINITIONS

**1.1 "Services"** shall mean the freight transportation services provided by FastTrack and the last-mile delivery services provided by UrbanDeliver, as further described in Schedule A attached hereto.

**1.2 "Freight"** shall refer to all goods, commodities, and merchandise transported under this Agreement, including but not limit‡ed to electronics, apparel, and peris™h¶ables.

**1.3 "Delivery Areas"** shall include the following locations for last-mile delivery: Manhattan (NY), Brooklyn (NY), Newark (NJ), Philadelphia (PA), and Boston (MA).

**1.4 "Service Level Agreements (SLAs)"** shall detail the performance metrics and timelines set forth in Schedule B.

### ARTICLE II: SCOPE OF SERVICES

**2.1 Freight Transportation**  
FastTrack shall provide trucking services to transport Freight from QuickShip’s warehouse located at 123 Shipping Lane, Wilmington, DE, to UrbanDeliver’s distribution points in the Delivery Areas.

**2.2 Last-Mile Delivery**  
Ur®banDeliver shall be responsible for the last-mile delivery of Freight from its distribution points to end customers, ensuring timely and secure delivery.

**2.3 Joint Operations**  
QuickShip, FastTrack, and UrbanDeliver shall conduct joint operational meetings bi-weekly to review performance metrics, address any issues, and ensure compliance with SLAs.

### ARTICLE III: COMPENSATION

**3.1 Freight Charges**  
QuickShip agree®s to pay FastTrack a base rate of $2.50 per mile for trucking services, plus a fuel surcharge as determined by the U.S. Department of Energy’s average diesel price report. 

**3.2 Last-Mile Delivery Charges**  
QuickShip shall pay UrbanDeliver $5.00 per delivery, with an additional $2.00 for deliveries requiring special handling.

**3.3 Invoicing**  
FastTrack and UrbanDeliver shall submit monthly invoices to QuickShip by the 5th of each month. Payment shall be due within thirty (30) days of receipt of the invoice.

### ARTICLE IV: WARRANTIES AND REPRESENTATIONS

**4.1 Authority**  
Each party represents and warrants that it has the author™ity to enter into this Agreement and that it will comply with all applicable laws and regulations.

**4.2 Performance Standards**  
FastTrack and UrbanDeliver warrant that they will adhere to the performance standards set forth in the SLAs, maintaining a delivery accuracy rate of 98% and on-time delivery rate of 95%.

**4.3 Insurance**  
FastTrack shall maintain commercial liability insurance with a ‡minimum coverage of $1,000,000 per occurrence. UrbanDeliver shall maintain cargo insurance covering the full value of the Freight transported.

### ARTICLE V: TERM AND TERMINATION

**5.1 Term**  
This Agreement shall commence on the Effective Date and shall continue for a term of three (3) years, unless terminated earlier in accordance with this Article.

**5.2 Termination for Convenience**  
Any party may terminate this Agreement for any reason by providing thirty (30) days written notice to the other parties.

**5.3 Termination for Cause**  
If any party fails to comply with the terms of t†his Agreement, the non-breaching party may terminate this Agreement by providing written notice detailing the breach and allowing the breaching party fifteen (15) days to cure said breach.

